From 08d4af26826c96dd72170bbdc32425a8df028a2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Ryan X. Charles" <ryan@ryanxcharles.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 06:17:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 130/144] Host-mediated file chooser (park listener, no engine
 panel)

Ordinary open/upload parks FileSelectListener and emits host
FileChooserRequest; ts_reply_file_chooser completes paths/cancel.
Auto-select remains engine-local. Removes product ui::SelectFileDialog.
